.env*
!.env.example

# Node / pnpm workspace
node_modules/
**/node_modules/
pnpm-debug.log*
.pnpm-store/

# Build outputs
apps/bridge/out/
apps/mobile/dist/
**/target/
**/*.tsbuildinfo

# NOTE: apps/mobile/src-tauri/gen/ is intentionally NOT ignored — upstream
# commits the generated Android project scaffold (Gradle needs it present;
# `**/target/` above already covers Rust's own build output; the Gradle
# `build/` dir under gen/android is already covered by that project's own
# gen/android/.gitignore).

# APKs built via apps/mobile/docker/build-apk.sh land here — never commit a
# built binary.
/dist/
# Rust client workspace (migration F1)
/target
/crates/**/target
